# Romania (additions to data/extracted/ro/).

lg:RO-LCE
    lgo:shortName "L. 365/2002" ;
    eli:id_local "M.Of. nr. 483 din 5 iulie 2002" ;
    eli:transposes lg:EU-2000-31 ;
    rdfs:comment "Articolul 5 transposes Article 5 of the e-Commerce Directive, wider than the Directive's catalogue: phone and fax numbers, the fiscal registration code and price items are mandatory for every provider."@en .
